<title>LITHUANIA: SHARES DIP SLIGHTLY, NO BIG GAINS SEEN.</title>
<headline>SHARES DIP SLIGHTLY, NO BIG GAINS SEEN.</headline>
<text>
<p>* Total market turnover was just over 2.5 million litas</p>
<p>* Central market turnover was just over two million litas</p>
<p>* The official list index rose by 12.14 points to 992.95</p>
<p>* The Litin A index slipped 7.63 points to 2,572.75</p>
</text>
